# Tournament Engine V2

Read **`docs/TOURNAMENT-ENGINE-V2.md`** before changing tournament code.

## Rules

- Keep mock mode (`engine-mock.ts`) — never remove
- All real API calls via `lib/tournament/providers/*` adapters
- **Groq** for: challenge_generation, competitor_execution, preliminary_judging
- **Claude/GPT** for: final_judging, benchmark_report, marketplace_polish, enterprise_review
- Router: `lib/tournament/router/` — never hardcode provider in UI
- Rate limit guard runs before each loop in `/api/tournament/run`
- Log usage to `provider_usage_logs` (graceful if table missing)

